.IP \(bu 2
Logarithmic units \f[B]bel\f[R] and \f[B]neper\f[R] do not currently
support conversion.
.IP \(bu 2
Temperature conversions are not currently supported.
\f[B]degree celsius\f[R] is treated as \f[B]kelvin\f[R].
.IP \(bu 2
The formatted UTF\-8 outputs for \f[B]degree\f[R] use
\f[I]DEGREE_SIGN\f[R](U+00B0)_.
.IP \(bu 2
The formatted output for \f[B]litre\f[R] uses
\f[I]LATIN CAPITAL LETTER L (U+004C)\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
The parser for \f[B]litre\f[R] also accepts
\f[I]LATIN SMALL LETTER L (U+006C)\f[R].
